// Grounded Brain: editing a source (title, or text/markdown content)
// Eraser "Sequence Diagram" diagram-as-code. Paste into a new Sequence diagram at https://app.eraser.io
title Edit a source: replace, never append
autoNumber on

Client [icon: monitor, color: gray] > SourceService [icon: nodejs, color: green]: PATCH /sources/:id {title?, content?, expectedUpdatedAt?}
SourceService > Postgres [icon: postgres, color: blue]: load source (ownership); 400 non-text content, 409 PENDING or PROCESSING
alt [label: title only] {
  SourceService > Pinecone [icon: database, color: blue]: update sourceTitle on each chunk vector (no re-embedding)
  SourceService > Postgres: compare-and-set UPDATE where updatedAt = read value and status idle
}
else [label: content changed] {
  SourceService > Postgres: compare-and-set UPDATE content, wordCount, status PENDING
  SourceService > Postgres: delete chunks
  SourceService > Pinecone: delete vectors for the source
  SourceService > Inngest [icon: zap, color: purple]: send source/created
  Inngest > ProcessSourceJob [icon: file-text, color: purple]: re-chunk, embed, upsert, READY
}
SourceService --> Client: 200 source (same shape as GET, with content); 409 CONFLICT when stale
